#: 9bbb67d8ebb94e798a0ec32c3bd73629
msgid "**\"Recommended\"** means that the model is fit specifically for this spatial resolution. Any images of higher resolution will be downsampled before processing, so it gives no profit to upload higher resolution. Images of lower resolution (if meeting the \"required\" section) will be upsampled, but the results will not be so good as for recommended resolution."
